Over here in our little Fig Tree neck of the[ woods], we are a bit tired and certainly dazed by all of your shopping prowess. You guyss are quite a dedicated bunch and we really appreciate you!
For this last day we have a grab[ bag] of little[ goodies]. All those little items that we didn't manage to share on any other day. We have: LITTLE BAG O' PEARL BUTTONS,[ TW]INE, CHARMS, POT HOLDERS & a few new BUNDLES.
